 advised to show your working.","topics":["1-2-3-price-income-cross-elasticities-of-demand","3-3-1-revenue"],"board":"edexcel","groups":["theme-1","theme-3"],"keywords":["total revenue","price elasticity of demand","tea","calculation"],"qpPage":4,"msPage":5,"ctxPage":null,"modelAnswer":null},{"id":"edexcel-as-p1-2017-jun-q6c","p":28,"section":"B","questionNumber":"6(c)","parentQuestion":"6","choiceGroup":null,"marks":6,"questionText":"Explain how changes in the price of tobacco cigarettes may affect the demand for e-cigarettes over time.","topics":["1-2-3-price-income-cross-elasticities-of-demand"],"board":"edexcel","groups":["theme-1"],"keywords":["cross elasticity of demand","substitutes","XED","e-cigarettes"],"qpPage":13,"msPage":15,"ctxPage":11,"modelAnswer":null},{"id":"edexcel-as-p1-2017-jun-q6d","p":28,"section":"B","questionNumber":"6(d)","parentQuestion":"6","choiceGroup":null,"marks":4,"questionText":"With reference to Extract A, lines 11–13, calculate the price elasticity of demand for tobacco cigarettes in high-income countries and in low-middle-income countries. You are advised to show your working.","topics":["1-2-3-price-income-cross-elasticities-of-demand"],"board":"edexcel","groups":["theme-1"],"keywords":["price elasticity of demand","PED","calculation","tobacco"],"qpPage":13,"msPage":16,"ctxPage":11,"modelAnswer":null},{"id":"edexcel-as-p1-2017-jun-q6e","p":28,"section":"B","questionNumber":"6(e)","parentQuestion":"6","choiceGroup":null,"marks":15,"questionText":"With reference to Figure 1, assess the likely reasons for the difference in price elasticity of demand for tobacco cigarettes and e-cigarettes.","topics":["1-2-3-price-income-cross-elasticities-of-demand"],"board":"edexcel","groups":["theme-1"],"keywords":["price elasticity of demand","PED","addiction","substitutes"],"qpPage":13,"msPage":17,"ctxPage":11,"modelAnswer":null},{"id":"edexcel-as-p1-2016-jun-q5b","p":27,"section":"A","questionNumber":"5(b)","parentQuestion":"5","choiceGroup":nu